{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529430?t=1745499754","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529430?t=1745499754","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529430/efd78a2f8d1a4a984e0cb6c29dd83c5950675385/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745499754","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529430/efd78a2f8d1a4a984e0cb6c29dd83c5950675385/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745499754","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlists</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Our goal is to reach 10,000 wishlists to bring our game to more players! If you haven\u2019t added our game to your wishlist yet, you can do it now and follow us to learn more about the game.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Thank you to everyone who believes in our project, supports us, and adds our game to their wishlist!</i></strong></p></p><br><h1>About Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>This is the demo version of Zilar: Empire of the Underground. It allows players to experience the core gameplay mechanics that will be featured in the full version.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>In the demo, you can access the following content:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\ud83d\udd39 Introduction to the Main Story \u2013 Our protagonist is forced into an adventure after hearing a mysterious sound from the next room while reading a book.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\ud83d\udd39 Exploring the First Area \u2013 Players can explore the protagonist\u2019s antique room and examine various objects inside.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\ud83d\udd39 Parkour Mechanics \u2013 A special section designed to test your parkour skills.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\ud83d\udd39 Combat Mechanics \u2013 A short, action-packed battle sequence against the Yeclers, the people of Zilar.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\ud83d\udd39 Puzzles &amp; Exploration \u2013 Follow clues to uncover the Yeclers' mysterious world and join the adventure.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\ud83d\udd39 Guiding Voice-over \u2013 Navigate the game world more easily with the help of a narrator within the demo.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>This demo is designed to give you a glimpse of the game's atmosphere and gameplay. The full version will offer even more content, an expanded story, and brand-new mechanics waiting to be discovered!</i></strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Sthard Game"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3034530","name":"Zilar: Empire Of The Underground"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529430/53366c48e7d53204ad49e417549beaa6e475a1de/header.jpg?t=1745499754","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114525,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114525